,"tr":"rabbika","f":["M","GEN"],"r":3,"l":10,"g":[["رَبِّ","N","stem","M|GEN"],["كَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:2MS"]]},{"i":"17:38:7","a":"مَكْرُوهًۭا","t":"hateful","p":"N","tr":"makrūhan","f":["PASS","PCPL","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":237,"l":3676},{"e":"٣٨","v":"17:38"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"17:28","t":"And if you [must] turn away from them [i.e., the needy] awaiting mercy from your Lord which you expect, then speak to them a gentle word.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"17:29","t":"And do not make your hand [as] chained to your neck or extend it completely and [thereby] become blamed and insolvent.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"17:30","t":"Indeed, your Lord extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it]. Indeed He is ever, concerning His servants, Aware and Seeing.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"17:31","t":"And do not kill your children for fear of poverty. We provide for them and for you. Indeed, their killing is ever a great sin.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"17:32","t":"And do not approach unlawful sexual intercourse. Indeed, it is ever an immorality and is evil as a way.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"17:33","t":"And do not kill the soul [i.e., person] which Allāh has forbidden, except by right. And whoever is killed unjustly - We have given his heir authority, but let him not exceed limits in [the matter of] taking life. Indeed, he has been supported [by the law].","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"17:34","t":"And do not approach the property of an orphan, except in the way that is best, until he reaches maturity. And fulfill [every] commitment. Indeed, the commitment is ever [that about which one will be] questioned.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"17:35","t":"And give full measure when you measure, and weigh with an even [i.e., honest] balance. That is the best [way] and best in result.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"17:36","t":"And do not pursue that of which you have no knowledge. Indeed, the hearing, the sight and the heart - about all those [one] will be questioned.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"17:37","t":"And do not walk upon the earth exultantly. Indeed, you will never tear the earth [apart], and you will never reach the mountains in height.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"17:38","t":"All that [i.e., the aforementioned] - its evil is ever, in the sight of your Lord, detested.","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":38,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}